WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Before the pitch, every defender has a job. Start with the ball.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
A ground ball goes to shortstop. The shortstop fields it.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Second base is covered by the second baseman. First base stays ready.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
If the ball goes to second base, the shortstop covers second.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Choose your job: get the ball, cover a base, or back up.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Now try the play. Where should you go when the ball moves?
